Important Current Logic (SME-aligned update)
The retrieval policy currently varies search depth and report selection:
•	complete + recurring: latest report only policy
•	incomplete: backsearch until completion evidence policy
•	complete + non-recurring: backsearch until completion evidence policy
•	otherwise: bounded full-history default
This behavior is implemented in:
•	derive_prior_service_retrieval_policy in fsr_completion.py
•	policy application in run_service_history_completion_service and report selection in evidence summarization
